# The roster maps real names to the short names shown on the site. It is the
# only file that holds both, so it must never be committed to a public repo.
# Keep a backup somewhere private — player ids come from here, and losing it
# means everyone gets renumbered.
/pipeline/roster.local.json

# python
__pycache__/

# markdown files
*.md
!README.md